-- Sub-phase 1.6: notifications, and the per-workspace system user's CHECKs.
--
-- Written fresh for Islestone (docs/porting/maps/1.6.md, "Prisma models and
-- migrations"). inflect-compliance spreads these tables over twelve
-- migrations at 5528464fc54a8681956f3b9ce23ca9c075f0420e; they were read for
-- intent and not replayed, so no dropped default or compliance enum value
-- comes along. The system-user part follows inflect's
-- `20261029200000_tenant_system_user` over the tables Islestone has.
--
-- Sections:
--   1) Enums, tables, indexes and foreign keys (generated by
--      `prisma migrate diff` from prisma/schema/notifications.prisma)
--   2) Grants to app_user
--   3) Canonical RLS on the three tenant tables
--   4) The system user: namespace preflight, row shape, and the refusal of
--      the reserved id in every table that would let it sign in or hold
--      standing

-- ─── 1) Enums, tables, indexes, foreign keys ──────────────────────

